{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-11-16 16:45:00', 'title': 'CENTENE APPOINTS MONTE FORD TO BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'ST. LOUIS , NOV. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CENTENE CORPORATION (NYSE: CNC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS APPOINTED MONTE FORD TO THE CENTENE BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE NOVEMBER 12 TH. MR. FORD IS A LEADING TECHNOLOGIST WITH MORE THAN 20 YEARS OF BOARD EXPERIENCE SERVING FORTUNE 500 COMPANIES ACROSS A WIDE SPECTRUM OF INDUSTRIES.'}